          <attvalue for="5" value="Thought: I received an error when trying to access the Eventbrite page directly. Let's try a different approach. I'll search for specific fitness studios or gyms in San Francisco that might have classes on Saturdays, and then check their websites for May 3rd classes.&#10;&#10;Code:&#10;```py&#10;search_query = &quot;best fitness studios San Francisco Saturday classes&quot;&#10;studio_results = web_search(query=search_query)&#10;print(studio_results)&#10;```&lt;end_code&gt;" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="Execution logs:&#10;## Search Results&#10;&#10;[Get Sweaty: 32 Unique Workout Studios in San Francisco](https://www.7x7.com/32-unique-workout-studios-san-francisco-2639319186.html)&#10;Core40 utilizes the Lagree Fitness method to get your heart pumping and muscles shaking during their 40-minute full body megaformer workout. With seven sleek, wood-floored studios, Core40 is a San Francisco favorite for megaformer veterans and newbies alike—and the only place to give the Lagree Fitness Ramped technology a try in SF.&#10;&#10;[TOP 10 BEST Fitness Class in San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/search?find_desc=fitness+class&amp;find_loc=San+Francisco,+CA)&#10;Top 10 Best Fitness Class in San Francisco, CA - June 2024 - Yelp - YuBalance, Pure Barre, The Firm SF, Pilates Tiburon Firon Fitness, The Garage, HIT Fit SF, BODYROK - Haight Studio, Orangetheory Fitness - Pacific Heights, Movement For Everyone, Midline&#10;&#10;[The 9 Best Workout Classes In San Francisco](https://sanfran.com/best-workout-classes-san-francisco)&#10;Boasting itself as &quot;San Francisco's last real boxing gym,&quot; the group classes at 3rd Street have attendees working up a serious sweat. Three beginner-level courses teach the basics and fine-tune technique, while &quot;old-school&quot; offerings are on the heavy bag and the cheeky &quot;tough love&quot; class includes cardio and conditioning exercises.&#10;&#10;[Top 10 Best Fitness Classes in San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/search?find_desc=fitness+classes&amp;find_loc=San+Francisco,+CA)&#10;Top 10 Best Fitness Classes in San Francisco, CA - November 2023 - Yelp - YuBalance, Midline, Regulate, HIT Fit SF, Barry's Bootcamp Castro, Active Pilates, Wheel House, 3rd Street Boxing Gym, Live Fit Gym - Inner Richmond, CORE40 Lower Pacific Heights&#10;&#10;[BEST of San Francisco, CA Exercise Classes - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/search?find_desc=exercise+classes&amp;find_loc=San+Francisco,+CA)&#