          <attvalue for="5" value="Thought: I'm getting general information about ClassPass in San Francisco, but not specific classes for our target date. Let me try searching for some of the specific studios mentioned earlier and their Saturday class schedules, focusing on a few of the top-rated ones from the search results.&#10;&#10;Let's check Barry's Bootcamp, BODYROK, and HIT Fit SF since they're mentioned multiple times in the search results.&#10;&#10;Code:&#10;```py&#10;studios_to_check = [&#10;    &quot;Barry's Bootcamp San Francisco Saturday classes&quot;,&#10;    &quot;BODYROK San Francisco Saturday classes&quot;,&#10;    &quot;HIT Fit SF Saturday classes&quot;&#10;]&#10;&#10;for studio in studios_to_check:&#10;    print(f&quot;\n--- {studio} ---&quot;)&#10;    search_results = web_search(query=studio)&#10;    print(search_results)&#10;```&lt;end_code&gt;" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="Execution logs:&#10;&#10;--- Barry's Bootcamp San Francisco Saturday classes ---&#10;## Search Results&#10;&#10;[FiDi San Francisco Studio: Book a Workout Class | Barry's](https://www.barrys.com/studio/fidi/)&#10;Charmingly nestled in the heart of San Francisco's Financial District, Barry's FiDi is in the perfect location for SF's work hard, play hard professional crowd. ... Saturday - Sunday: 7:00am - 1:30pm. Contact. 415-544-9934 [email protected] Features. ... Mini towels for class and lovely big towels for showers after class. *Amenities may not ...&#10;&#10;[Gym in the Marina District: Book a Workout Class | Barry's](https://www.barrys.com/studio/san-francisco-marina/)&#10;San Francisco, CA 94123. Hours of Operation. Monday, Wednesday, Friday: 6:00am - 8:00pm ... Visit the Fuel Bar, Barry's in-house hub for health and wellness. We've got customized shakes and grab and go goodies that will help you run faster, lift heavier and recover more quickly. ... Mini towels for class and lovely big towels for showers ...&#10;&#10;[6+ Best Boot Camp Classes in San Francisco [2024]](https://livefitgym.com/best-bootcamp-classes-san-francisco/)&#10;Here are the best boot camp classes in San Francisco. Inner Richmond location is turning 8! Celebrate with $0 Enrollment until April 12. ... Barry's Bootcamp Castro. Location: Various locations throughout San Francisco. Hours: Monday - Thursday: 5:30 am -8:00 pm; Friday: 5:30 am-7:00 pm; Saturday: 7 am-4:00 pm; Sunday: 7 am -6 pm;&#10;&#10;[Barry's Marina - San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/biz/barrys-marina-san-francisco)&#10;BARRY'S MARINA, 2246 Lombard St, San Francisco, CA 94123, 188 Photos, Mon - 6:00 am - 8:00 pm, Tue - 5:00 am - 8:00 pm, Wed - 6:00 am - 8:00 pm, Thu - 5:00 am - 8:00 pm, Fri - 6:00 am - 8:00 pm, Sat - 7:00 am - 4:00 pm, Sun - 7:00 am - 3:00 pm ... Barry's boot camp at the Marina location is such a clean and nice facility. I took Brian's class ...&#10;&#10;[Barry's Bootcamp Castro - San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/biz/barry-s-bootcamp-castro-san-francisco?start=10)&#10;Established in 1998. In 1998, LA based celebrity trainer Barry Jay has the idea for a one-stop cardio and strength training workout that actually works. Barry Jay partners with John and Rachel Mumford to open the first Barry's Bootcamp in West Hollywood and together they launch the boutique fitness studio revolution.&#10;&#10;[Barry's Northern California | San Francisco CA - Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/BarrysCastro/)&#10;Next Saturday our Barry's CEO will be back in the Castro red room so save your spot now for his 12:30pm 💪‼️💥 ... Starting Feb 18th take 10 or 20 classes in 30 days to win special prizes! ... Barry's Northern California, San Francisco, California. 498 likes · 3 talking about this · 2,342 were here. ...&#10;&#10;[Barry's Bootcamp - San Francisco, CA - SpinSyddy](https://spinsyddy.com/barrys-bootcamp-san-francisco-ca/)&#10;What: Barry's Bootcamp Where: San Francisco, CA - SOMA Instructor: Paul W. When: Mon - Fri: 5:30am - 9:30pm / Sat: 6:30am - 2:30pm / Sun: 7:45am - 6:00pm Why: Barry's Bootcamp has pioneered its way through the group fitness scene. From opening the very first studio in 1998 out of West Hollywood, to now having over 40k members including celebrities like Ellie Goulding, David ...&#10;&#10;[Barry's FiDi - San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/biz/barrys-fidi-san-francisco?start=20)&#10;97 reviews of Barry's FiDi &quot;I've been going to Barry's for 7-mths twice/week now and am not the fanboy type, but the Barry's SF team really outdid themselves this time. Same workout and same great instructors, but 50-mins workouts on weekdays. Gorgeous new studio, locker alley/hallway slightly more room now and lockers have built-in USB port for charging your phones.&#10;&#10;[Gym in Castro, San Francisco: Book a Workout Class | Barry's](https://www.barrys.com/studio/castro/)&#10;Where to find us. 2280 Market Street (Corner of 16th &amp; Noe) San Francisco, CA 94114 View on Map&#10;&#10;[Best San Francisco Studio and Instructors? : r/barrysbootcamp - Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/barrysbootcamp/comments/15e6azu/best_san_francisco_studio_and_instructors/)&#10;In the city, the quality of your Barry's experience greatly relies on the instructor you choose. We also have studios in Burlingame, Palo Alto, and San Jose. Castro is the busiest studio in the nation; it offers two types of classes - regular and just LIFT. Hence, it has longer waitlists and a higher turnover. Cooler vibe.&#10;&#10;--- BODYROK San Francisco Saturday classes ---&#10;## Search Results&#10;&#10;[Polk - Best Pilates Membership - Classes &amp; Packages - BODYROK](https://bodyrok.com/studio/polk/)&#10;1850 Polk Street - San Francisco, CA 94109 polk@bodyrok.com. ROK The New Year. 50% Off The First Two Months. 4x A Month $64.50. $129 After The First Two Months. 8x A Month $94.50. $189 After The First Two Months. ... you'll be automatically added to the class and will receive an automated email. If a spot opens up within that 12 hour window ...&#10;&#10;[BODYROK | Downtown San Francisco](https://downtownsf.org/go/bodyrok)&#10;San Francisco, CA 94104 (415) 890-2765. Visit Website. View on Google Maps. Social Media. Details. Pilates inspired, 45-min, full body, strength training group classes on the custom BODYROK reformer. Our hybrid pilates sequences will have you plank, lunge, squeeze, pike, jump, ... Saturday/Sunday: 9 am - 12 pm. Gym. Nearby Restaurants.&#10;&#10;[Best Pilates Membership - Classes &amp; Packages | BODYROK](https://bodyrok.com/)&#10;Pilates inspired, 45 minute, full body strength training group classes on the custom BODYROK reformer. Our hybrid Pilates sequences will have you plank, lunge, squeeze, pike, jump, and push your body. The BODYROK experience is designed to create more energy and increase your metabolism, working for you even after you leave. COME ROK WITH US!&#10;&#10;[BODYROK - San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/biz/bodyrok-san-francisco-9)&#10;I thought this was a great deal but I just checked my billing statement to another $320 charge from BodyRok. I had missed a couple classes and, while I understand there is a $20 fee for missed classes, as a new member I would think the studio would reach out to me if my fees are doubling my membership cost but I guess taking my money was the ...&#10;&#10;[BODYROK MISSION Studio: High-Energy Cycle Classes in San Francisco, CA](https://humblechallenger.com/gym/bodyrok-mission-studio/)&#10;Discover BODYROK MISSION Studio in San Francisco, CA, offering high-energy cycle classes with Griselda. Experience a fun, motivating, and community-driven workout with great music and an inclusive atmosphere. Fitness Blog; ... Saturday, 7:30 AM - 1:00 PM Sunday, 8:00 AM - 1:00 PM ...&#10;&#10;[FiDi - Best Pilates Membership - Classes &amp; Packages - BODYROK](https://bodyrok.com/studio/fidi/)&#10;300 Pine Street, San Francisco, CA 94104 fidi@bodyrok.com. Intro. For our first time visitors. 30 day expiration. First Class $20. 5 Classes $99. Unlimited $149. Packages. For our noncommittal ROKSTARS. Valid for 6 months. ... If you arrive soon after class starts and your spot was given away, you will receive your class credit back and our ...&#10;&#10;[BODYROK - Marina: Read Reviews and Book Classes on ClassPass](https://classpass.qa/studios/bodyrok-marina-san-francisco)&#10;BODYROK offers a pilates-inspired, 45-minute, full-body, strength training on the custom BODYROK Reformer. Our hybrid pilates sequences will have you plank, lunge, squeeze, pike, jump and push your body. The BODYROK experience is designed to create more energy and increase your metabolism, working for you even after you leave. COME ROK WITH US!&#10;&#10;[SAN FRANCISCO LANDING PAGE - Best Pilates Membership - Classes ...](https://bodyrok.com/san-francisco/)&#10;© Best Pilates Membership - Classes &amp; Packages | BODYROK. Do Not Sell My Personal Information. Site by Smash&#10;&#10;[BODYROK MISSION Studio in San Francisco, CA 94110 - (415) 8...](https://www.chamberofcommerce.com/united-states/california/san-francisco/pilates-studio/2005516312-bodyrok-mission-studio)&#10;BODYROK MISSION Studio located at 3585 20th St, San Francisco, CA 94110 - reviews, ratings, hours, phone number, directions, and more. Search Find a Business; Add Your Business; Jobs; Advice; ... Saturday: 7:30 AM - 1:00 PM. CALL DIRECTIONS REVIEWS. Chamber Rating ...&#10;&#10;[BodyRok - San Francisco, CA](https://www.yelp.com/biz/bodyrok-san-francisco-11)&#10;Specialties: BODYROK offers a high intensity, low impact Sculpt Class that will tone, sculpt and redefine your body and mind in just 40 minutes. Bring on the heart pumping music, high energy instructors, beautiful studios, and your muscles will be pushed to the limit.&#10;&#10;--- HIT Fit SF Saturday classes ---&#10;## Search Results&#10;&#10;[Classes — Hit Fit SF](https://www.hitfitsf.com/classes/)&#10;HIIT. A 1 hour high Intensity blast of strength, cardio and core to take your conditioning to the next level. Think kettlebells, battle ropes, TRX, box jumps, slam balls and bodyweight drills. Quickies. Sometimes you're in a rush! Same as our HIIT Fit but get in, get worked and get out in just 40 minutes!&#10;&#10;[Free Classes this Saturday at HIT Fit SF open to everyone! Hey ...](https://www.facebook.com/HitFitSF/videos/free-classes-this-saturday-at-hit-fit-sf-open-to-everyonehey-everybody-we-are-sh/1489102501355207/)&#10;Free Classes this Saturday at HIT Fit SF open to everyone! Hey everybody! We are shooting our first ever promo video for HIT Fit SF this Saturday Sept 27th . We need a full house (ie. Lots of people!!) so we are hosting a morning of free classes open to everyone. If you haven't tried out HIT Fit SF yet...now's your chance! Bring a friend and make a morning out of it! Lielen, Simon, Cole ...&#10;&#10;[Purchase — Hit Fit SF](https://www.hitfitsf.com/purchase)&#10;O